I hate you.


01:05:32.267 --> 01:05:34.531
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:34.703 --> 01:05:36.398
I know.


01:05:38.073 --> 01:05:40.906
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:41.076 --> 01:05:42.737
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:42.911 --> 01:05:45.744
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:45.914 --> 01:05:47.006
Are you an idiot?


01:05:47.182 --> 01:05:49.343
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:49.517 --> 01:05:51.382
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:51.553 --> 01:05:53.953
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:05:54.122 --> 01:05:56.317
You're annoying and ugly...


01:05:56.491 --> 01:05:57.890
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:00.328 --> 01:06:01.955
I sort of love you too.


01:06:02.564 --> 01:06:07.024
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:07.502 --> 01:06:09.094
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:09.270 --> 01:06:11.204
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:11.372 --> 01:06:12.862
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:13.775 --> 01:06:15.106
Okay.


01:06:15.376 --> 01:06:19.779
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:35.296 --> 01:06:38.925
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:39.200 --> 01:06:41.361
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:41.536 --> 01:06:43.629
Oh, okay.


01:06:43.805 --> 01:06:46.330
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:47.242 --> 01:06:51.144
