01:07:43.464 --> 01:07:46.297
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:47.101 --> 01:07:48.568
You have talent.


01:07:48.736 --> 01:07:52.228
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:52.473 --> 01:07:54.805
