01:07:55.510 --> 01:07:57.239
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:07:57.412 --> 01:07:59.346
Just look at Mom.


01:08:01.516 --> 01:08:02.642
You think I'm talented?


01:08:04.452 --> 01:08:06.545
