01:08:08.256 --> 01:08:09.780
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:09.958 --> 01:08:11.926
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:15.029 --> 01:08:16.257
This better work.


01:08:16.831 --> 01:08:19.061
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:32.046 --> 01:08:35.709
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:35.884 --> 01:08:38.978
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:39.153 --> 01:08:43.146
