01:11:51.412 --> 01:11:53.880
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:54.048 --> 01:11:57.950
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:00.755 --> 01:12:02.120
Move it. Guy.


01:12:02.290 --> 01:12:06.488
