How dare you? Teaching is my life.


01:21:11.939 --> 01:21:13.873
Give it up, Mom.


01:21:16.076 --> 01:21:17.543
Guy!


01:21:18.879 --> 01:21:22.542
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:22.783 --> 01:21:26.549
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:28.022 --> 01:21:31.082
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:31.258 --> 01:21:33.852
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:34.028 --> 01:21:35.586
Let's try this again.


01:21:35.796 --> 01:21:37.661
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:39.233 --> 01:21:41.963
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:07.628 --> 01:22:09.858
Hey. Clear.


01:22:25.546 --> 01:22:27.707
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:27.881 --> 01:22:30.247
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:12.126 --> 01:23:14.720
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:14.895 --> 01:23:17.762
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:22.736 --> 01:23:26.263
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:32.713 --> 01:23:34.772
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:39.953 --> 01:23:44.253
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:48.695 --> 01:23:51.687
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:51.865 --> 01:23:53.992
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:13.487 --> 01:24:15.352
I love my life.


01:24:15.522 --> 01:24:17.717
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:40.180 --> 01:24:43.377
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

